{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美元匯價從十八個月高位回落。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要幣的美元匯價，回落百分之0.5，至貼近102。雖然美國新公布的9月生產物價指數，同樣反映通脹壓力增加，但市場逐漸消化有關消息，並把焦點轉至人工智能股份價格震盪之上。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.289655+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:47.146100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:47.146100+00:00","content_hash":"ec8ad0b0e5b129159d4012838a3f62ab92b961bcec06f8e2222bdbbd18ac5194","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}